@verbs earmuffs
@tier player
@title stop hearing shouts
@see say channels

  earmuffs           tells whether you are wearing them.
  earmuffs yes       puts them on.
  earmuffs no        takes them off.

With your earmuffs on you hear nobody's shouts. You cannot shout
either: there is little point in calling out to somebody who will not
hear the answer. They can also be changed from 'configuration'.
